sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Op as Operator
    participant CLI as Ingest CLI
    participant FS as Corpus files
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Emb as Embedding API

    Op->>CLI: python -m sourceline.ingest --root ../..
    CLI->>DB: pg_try_advisory_lock('sourceline:ingest')
    alt lock held
        CLI-->>Op: exit 5 (ingest_locked)
    else lock acquired
        CLI->>FS: discover allow-listed Markdown, sorted
        CLI->>FS: read + normalise + hash
        CLI->>DB: load existing documents/chunks
        CLI->>CLI: plan new / changed / unchanged / deleted / profile_changed

        loop each changed or new document
            CLI->>CLI: parse headings, chunk, line ranges, IDs
            alt chunks need embeddings
                CLI->>Emb: embed batches (retry / Retry-After / deadline)
                Emb-->>CLI: vectors or classified error
            end
            CLI->>DB: BEGIN
            CLI->>DB: upsert chunks + delete stale IDs + update document
            alt commit succeeds
                CLI->>DB: COMMIT
            else failure
                CLI->>DB: ROLLBACK (old document remains)
            end
        end

        opt --prune
            CLI->>DB: delete documents absent from corpus (cascade chunks)
        end

        CLI->>DB: update index_state counts + built_at
        CLI->>DB: write ingest_runs report
        CLI->>DB: pg_advisory_unlock
        CLI-->>Op: report + exit 0/3/4
    end
